e.","short_summary":"A campus recreation stop with courts, a track, pool, and climbing wall.","evidence_claim":"The Brock Center includes an aquatics center, indoor running track, multi-purpose courts, fitness facilities, and an 18-foot climbing wall.","source_url":"https://www.rmc.edu/campus-life/health-wellness/brock-center/","source_title":"Brock Sports and Recreation Center | Randolph-Macon College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Entry requires a valid RMC ID or director’s pass; verify posted operating hours before going.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"rmc-outdoor-leadership-adventure","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"RMC Outdoor Leadership adventures","title":"Look for an outdoor adventure","subtitle":"Weekend activities organized through RMC","notes":"Check The BUZZ for an upcoming outdoor-leadership trip, then sign up only after reviewing the specific activity, transportation, equipment, and participation details.","short_summary":"A structured route to explore Virginia outdoors with other RMC students.","evidence_claim":"RMC reports that Outdoor Leadership offers weekend adventures during the semester, including hiking, rock climbing, apple picking, horseback riding, and rafting.","source_url":"https://www.rmc.edu/news/learning-beyond-the-classroom-getting-involved-at-rmc/","source_title":"Learning Beyond the Classroom: Getting Involved at RMC | Randolph-Macon College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2024-01-10","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Trips and eligibility vary; check The BUZZ and the specific trip information before registering.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"rmc-activities-carnival","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Activities Carnival","title":"Meet orga